Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Locomotives Chewing The Timetable
- Story & Context: During an unauthorized winter solstice session inside Vault Shaft 7, Lenox Baptiste rolled a battery of second pans onto the rail platform just as the midnight freight shunter ground its iron wheels across the frozen switches. The air was thick with the scent of burning valve oil and frostbitten mint tea as Baptiste’s crew matched the grinding diesel pace with a furious dembow kick, accidentally blowing the track-side transformer and cutting power to the signals. As the conductor leaned from his cabin window to scream into the gloom, vocal chanter Nia Beckford grabbed the loudspeaker horn and bellowed, "Rattling the zinc while the seeds sleep deep!" The resulting recording preserved both the engine's mechanical shriek and the roaring 16-piece brass fanfare that followed, sparking the entire Sprout Session movement when the bootleg cassette circulated among Oslo railway crews.
